# LSPosed / Vector modern-API module entry class.
#
# Modern (targetApiVersion >= 101) modules are discovered via this file at
# META-INF/xposed/java_init.list. One fully-qualified class name per line;
# blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# R8 note: ship `-adaptresourcefilecontents META-INF/xposed/java_init.list` so
# this name is rewritten if the entry class gets obfuscated (see app/proguard-rules.pro).
io.github.wg1337.regtrail.xposed.RegTrailModule
